tra-concentrated scoop is needed."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Each serving supplies 200 mg of caffeine."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"BREAKTHROUGH NITRIC OXIDE ANABOLIC STACK FOR MAXIMUM TRAINING INTENSITY DRIVING ROCK HARD MUSCLE GAINS*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"CAUTION: - This product contains extremely potent concentrations of muscle fuel. It is designed to provide experienced athletes with explosive gains, bursts of energy and massive anabolic surges. Use only if you are ready to take your workout to the next level of athletic performance."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 826302 JLG"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"FUELS MUSCLE VOLUMIZING WORKOUTS TO DELIVER STUNNING MUSCULARITY AND STRENGTH*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"INTRINSIC FATIGUE BUFFERS AND MUSCLE INTENSITY PUMPS FOR SUPERIOR ATHLETIC PERFORMANCE*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL & ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"POTENT, ULTRA CONCENTRATED PRE-WORKOUT HYBRID"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"POWERFUL, SUPER CONCENTRATED VASODILATOR FOR ASTOUNDING MUSCLE PUMPS AND EXPLOSIVE POWER*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"SPECTACULAR MUSCLE PUMPS. PUNISHING STRENGTH. RAZOR SHARP FOCUS."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Uses of beta-Alanine are licensed from Natural Alternatives International, Inc. under U.S. Patents 5,965,596; 6,172,098; and 6,426,361"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: For adult use only. Use only as directed. Do not exceed recommended daily intake. Do not use this product if you are pregnant or lactating. If you are taking medication or have a medical condition, consult a physician before using this product. Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Beyond RAW(TM) Ravage is a cutting-edge scientific formula that combines a N.O. Vasodilation Amplifier designed to rush muscle fueling factors and expand branched-chain amino acids into blood vessels, simultaneously triggering vasodilation and generating a massive anabolic environment.* Ravage then adds an ATP Optimizing Creatine Module to ramp up high-energy ATP production, explosive muscle power and strength, while increasing the amount of stored creatine in the muscles and natural creatine production.* Stacked on top is the Muscle Buffering System that activates an intrinsic fatigue controlling factor. To stimulate mental focus and intensity, Ravage adds a cascade of metabolic intensifiers that ignite calorie burning and fatty acid metabolism to intensify your neural drive, so you can shatter records and punch through sticking points.* The result? Ferocious workouts, superior muscularity, and dominating athletic performance.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Capsimax(TM)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Capsimax(TM) trademark belongs to OmniActive Health Technologies."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CarnoSyn(TM) Carnosine Synthesizer"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"HARNESS THE POWER OF BEYOND RAW(TM)'S VISIONARY PRE-WORKOUT FUSION - ONLY ONE SCOOP NECESSARY!"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"If you want to attain the ultimate in physique enhancement and athletic performance, you need a systematic plan of attack for success and nutrients that deliver to working muscles. Beyond RAW(TM) Ravage provides a pre-training, high-intensity explosion loaded with critical building blocks to generate super-charged workouts that produce unmatched muscularity, while triggering key anabolic factors in your body.* Within minutes of taking Ravage, you'll experience the blitz of ingredients designed specifically to create blazing energy as you strive to achieve bare-knuckle intensity, chiseled vascularity, muscle hardness and sustained strength."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"resVida promotes healthy aging"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"ResVida(R) is a registered trademark of DSM."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Soybeans."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 09836 0","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}